From: LGNative <luis@nativestride.io>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 22:23:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/28] Theme: derive all brand/chart colors from a generated
 brand scale

Replace hand-picked HSL/hex values with a single --brand-50..950 scale
(uicolors.app curve anchored at the #1FAD66 brand green). primary,
success, ring and chart-1..9 (monochrome ramp, light+dark) now derive
from it; chart-stone maps to a Flexoki neutral. The treemap resolves
its gain/loss ramp endpoints from --brand-*/--destructive at runtime
instead of hardcoded RGB triplets.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
